# RS-HOME (PR 316), RS-R4 and RS-R3 (PR 319): ada adds eve; eve logs in (eve's home and its three folders are made
# as eve); ada removes eve (the home set aside), removes again (no eve) and adds eve again; eve logs in to a new
# home under uid 1003.
hdesk: accounts 2
hdesk: login ada uid 1000
hdesk: approval ask want 8 uid 1000
hdesk: kern 1 pid
-hdesk: approval ask
=hdesk: terminal 1 ended, status 0
hdesk: logout ada
hdesk: login eve uid 1002
hdesk: logout eve
hdesk: login ada uid 1000
hdesk: approval ask want 8 uid 1000
hdesk: kern 1 pid
-hdesk: approval ask
=hdesk: terminal 1 ended, status 0
hdesk: logout ada
hdesk: login eve uid 1003
hdesk: logout eve
!sevenhorsesrun
